{"id":"631521","name":"简易辣白菜","author":"金凤栖梧","authorId":"8221247","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631521/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白菜","amount":"小半个"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"5瓣"},{"name":"姜","amount":"一块"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"看好食材。","img":"images/631521/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜切片，用盐沙2个小时。","img":"images/631521/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜姜，苹果全切碎末，或用料理机打成碎泥。","img":"images/631521/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加辣椒面、生抽、蚝油、味精、韩式辣酱拌匀。","img":"images/631521/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加白糖拌匀。","img":"images/631521/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"做成酱料。","img":"images/631521/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"白菜冲洗后攥去水分，放入酱料碗中。","img":"images/631521/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/631521/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入干净瓶中。","img":"images/631521/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"密封后放冰箱保存。","img":"images/631521/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"吃时取出。","img":"images/631521/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631521/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631521/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}